{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38063","headline":"赠隐逸 · 韩偓","name":"赠隐逸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静景须教静者寻，清狂何必在山阴。\n蠭穿窗纸尘侵砚，鸟鬬庭花露滴琴。\n莫笑乱离方解印，犹胜顚蹶未抽簪。\n筑金总得非名士，况是无人解筑金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}